\nGaming Monitor\nCurve Gaming Monitor\nFlat Gaming Monitor\nMonitor Arm\nSim Racing\nRacing Simulator Cockpit\nFlight Simulator Cockpit\nRacing Wheel and Pedals\nMonitor Stand\nSimucube\nAccessories\nGAMING PC\nCOMMUNITY\nJoin TT Mod\nLighting Mix Invitation\nCasemod Invitation\nMarketing Materials\n3D Maker\nThermaltake Esports League\nJoin Us on Social Media\nSUPPORT\nCustomer Support\nWarranty Policy\neRMA Service\nSoftware Downloads\nWHERE TO BUY\nSALE\nSearch\nLog in\nCart\nItem added to your cart\nView cart\nCheck out\nContinue shopping\nSkip to product information\nOpen media 1 in modal\nOpen media 2 in modal\nOpen media 3 in modal\nOpen media 4 in modal\nOpen media 5 in modal\nOpen media 6 in modal\n1\n/\nof\n6\nToughpower GF3 Snow 1200W Gold (2025 Version)\nToughpower GF3 Snow 1200W Gold (2025 Version)\nSKU:PS-TPD-1200FNFAGU-N\nRegular price\n$199.99 USD\nRegular price\nSale price\n$199.99 USD\nUnit price\n/\nper\nSale\nSold out\n80 PLUS Gold certified fully modular power supply with PCIe Gen5.1 native connector, high amperage +12V rail, advanced DC-DC & LLC design, Japanese capacitors, and industry-grade protections optimized for next-gen GPUs and ATX 3.1 systems.\nQuantity\n(0 in cart)\nDecrease quantity for Toughpower GF3 Snow 1200W Gold (2025 Version)\nIncrease quantity for Toughpower GF3 Snow 1200W Gold (2025 Version)\nAdd to cart\nCouldn't load pickup availability\nRefresh\nView full details\nDesign\nSpecification\nDownload\nHow-to Videos\nen-GF1_snow_750\nNext-Gen Ready with ATX 3.1 & PCIe Gen5.1\nBuilt to meet Intel ATX 3.1 power supply requirements and equipped with a native 12+4pin PCIe Gen5.1 modular connector to support next-generation GPUs.\nNote:\n1. Recommended wattage is an estimation of system power demand. Actual power demands may vary based on specific components, usage, and many other factors.\n2. Please follow the recommended power requirements from the GPU manufactures before using the 12VHPWR cable.\nPremium Japanese 105°C Capacitors\nAll main capacitors are high-quality Japanese-made for long-lasting reliability and stability under heavy loads.\nHigh Amperage Single +12V Rail & DC-DC + LLC Design\nProvides stable and powerful +12V output with precise voltage regulation for high-performance systems.\nAC INPUT\nInput Voltage: 100-240V~\nInput Current: 15.0A Max.\nFrequency: 47Hz - 63Hz\nDC OUTPUT\n+3.3V\n+5V\n+12V\n-12V\n+5VSB\nMax Output Current\n20A\n20A\n100A\n0.3A\n3.0A\nMax Output Power\n110W\n1200W\n3.6W\n15W\nTotal Power\n1200W\nFully Modular with Flat Cables\nHigh efficiency Zero Cable platform with low-profile flat cables improves airflow and cable management.\nConnector Type\nConnector Quantity\nCable Quantity\nCable Length\nMain Power(24Pin)\nX 1\nX 1\n550mm\nATX 12V(4+4Pin)\nX 2\nX 2\n700mm\nPCIe(6+2Pin)\nX 5\nX 1\n600mm\nX 2\n600mm+150mm\nPCIe(12+4Pin)600W\nX 2\nX 2\n600mm\nSATA(5Pin)\nX 6\nX 2\n450mm+150mm+150mm\nPeripheral(4Pin)\nX 4\nX 1\n450mm+150mm+150mm+150mm\nIndustry-Grade Safety Protections\nBuilt-in protections including Over Current Protection (OCP), Over Voltage Protection (OVP), Under Voltage Protection (UVP), Over Power Protection (OPP), Over Temperature Protection (OTP), and Short Circuit Protection (SCP) safeguard your system against electrical faults, providing peace of mind and reliable operation.\nOCP\nOver Current\nProtection\nOVP\nOver Voltage\nProtection\nUVP\nUnder Voltage\nProtection\nOPP\nOver Power\nProtection\nSCP\nShort Circuit\nProtection\nOTP\nOver Temperature\nProtection\n80 PLUS Gold Certified\nDelivers up to 90% power conversion efficiency under real-world load conditions, reducing wasted energy and heat.\nEco & Power Standards Support\nSupports Intel Deep Power Down C6/C7 states, ErP ready, and complies with Energy Star, RoHS, and WEEE standards.\nProduct Specifications\nP/N\nPS-TPD-1200FNFAGU-N\nWatts\n1200W\nMax Output Capacity\n1200W\nColor\nSnow\nDimensions\n150mm(W)x86mm(H)x140mm(D)\nPFC (Power Factor Correction)\nActive PFC\nPower Good Signal\n100-150 msec\nHold Up Time\n> 17msec at 80% load\nInput Current\n15.0A Max.\nInput Frequency Range\n47Hz - 63Hz\nInput Voltage\n100-240V~\nOperating Temperture\n0°C to + 40°C\nOperating Humidity\n20% to 90%\nStorage Temperture\n-20°C to + 70°C\nStorage Humidity\n5% to 95%, non-condensing\nCooling System\n135mm FDB fan\nEfficiency\nMeet 80 PLUS® Gold at 115Vac input.\nMTBF\n100\nSafety Approval\nFCC/ICES/CB/cTUVus\nPCI-E 6+2PIN\n4\nPCI-E 12+4PIN\n2\nUser Manual\nFile Name\nDescription\nSize\nVersion\nRelease Date\nDrivers & Software\nFile Name\nDescription\nSize\nVersion\nRelease Date\nCONTACT\nCustomer Support\nSales Partner Request\nMedia Contact\nSUPPORT\nSubmit A Request\nWarranty Policy\nHow to Find S/N\neRMA Service\nSoftware Downloads\nCOMMUNITY\nJoin TT Mod\nCaseMOD Invitation\nPress Release\nMarketing Materials\n3D Maker\nCOMPANY\nAbout Us\nStore Policy\nWhere to Buy\nLANGUAGE\nUnited States/Canada\nBrazil\nLatam\nSubscribe to our emails\nEmail\nFacebook\nInstagram\nYouTube\nTikTok\nTwitter\nTwitch\nDiscord\nReddit\nCountry/region\nUSD\n$ | United States\nCAD\n$ |\nCanada\nUSD\n$ |\nUnited States\nLanguage\nEnglish\nEnglish\nFrançais\n© 2026, Thermaltake USA\nPowered by Shopify\nChoosing a selection results in a full page refresh.\nOpens in a new window.",
